{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》本周五（11月6日）將播出大結局，而張曦雯備受矚目的半裸大露背重頭戲亦終於曝光。</p><p>在昨晚（3日）片尾播出的預告上，看到半裸張曦雯站在張智霖面前，還有一幕是她隔着浴室玻璃、赤裸面對鏡頭崩潰落淚的畫面，單是預告片已相當震撼</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:23.330700+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:47:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.601699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:14.601699+00:00","content_hash":"45d02ccb38a99a1bf35391521f4cb97b338099f181e3348c44cade722586d11c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}